  "title": "Ganges Delta is ours",
  "briefing": "Ironwood Trust holds Ganges Delta through its market lanes. Reconnect 3 relays, take down the site warden, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, then leave by the exit. Expect 12 enemy agents and 5 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Ganges Delta Blackout: Ironwood Trust runs Ganges Delta from its market lanes, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, silence the warden, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Ganges Delta wakes up with the market lanes in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Ganges Delta before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
